SUMMARY:Life Drawing – 3-hour long pose session
DESCRIPTION:Untutored sessions with live model\, undraped.\nAll mediums allowed. Please use non-odor solvents if using oil mediums.\nTen 1-minute poses to warm up\, and then one pose for the remaining time; 20-minute increments with 10-minute break in between each increment.  \nPre-registration is requested. You may register on site IF there is space available.
